DESCRIPTION:Virtual environments are a fundamental part of Python developme
 nt\, but to most developers\, they’re largely a ‘black box’. In this
  talk\, we’re gonna dissect the code\, file structure and utilities that
  make them up to deeply learn\, and not just have superficial knowledge of
 \, how venvs actually work.
